t\" content=\"RJLS Systems builds AI that works with existing products&#x27; data and workflows.\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://rjlssystems.com/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"AI for Your App&#x27;s Data and Workflows | RJLS Systems\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Add a useful AI interface to an existing application or service, with access and actions scoped to the workflow.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://rjlssystems.com/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png?40f83fcdd6e27089\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"200x200\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"dark min-h-[100dvh] bg-cream dark:bg-night\"><a class=\"fixed left-4 top-4 z-50 -translate-y-24 rounded-md bg-forest px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cream transition-transform hover:bg-navy focus:translate-y-0 dark:bg-forest dark:text-cream dark:hover:bg-mist dark:hover:text-navy\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to content</a><nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-forest/10 bg-cream dark:border-cream/20 dark:bg-night\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-[4.5rem] max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 lg:px-10\"><a class=\"group inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-md font-semibold text-navy focus-visible:outline-none dark:text-cream\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid size-10 flex-none place-items-center rounded-md bg-forest font-mono text-xs text-cream transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-active:translate-y-px dark:bg-forest dark:text-cream\">RJ</span><span class=\"truncate tracking-[-0.02em]\">RJLS Systems</span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 md:flex\"><a class=\"rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition duration-200 active:translate-y-px text-forest hover:bg-forest/5 hover:text-navy dark:text-sage dark:hover:bg-cream/[0.12] dark:hover:text-cream\" href=\"/our-process\">Our Process</a><a class=\"rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition duration-200 active:translate-y-px text-forest hover:bg-forest/5 hover:text-navy dark:text-sage dark:hover:bg-cream/[0.12] dark:hover:text-cream\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button aria-label=\"Switch to light mode\" class=\"group grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-md border border-forest/10 text-navy transition duration-200 hover:bg-forest/5 active:translate-y-px dark:border-cream/20 dark:text-sage dark:hover:bg-cream/[0.12]\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sun size-4 transition-transform group-hover:rotate-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41\"></path></svg></button><button aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open main menu\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-md border border-forest/10 text-navy transition hover:bg-forest/5 active:translate-y-px md:hidden dark:border-cream/20 dark:text-sage dark:hover:bg-cream/[0.12]\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-cream dark:bg-night\" id=\"main-content\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"page-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-30 dark:opacity-15\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24\"><p class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest dark:text-mint\">AI readiness audit</p><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.05em] md:text-6xl text-navy dark:text-cream\">Turn scattered AI activity into a practical next-step plan.</h1><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-8 text-forest dark:text-sage\">If your team is using AI but the right integration is not yet clear, the audit maps current usage, control gaps, and implementation opportunities into an ordered roadmap.</p><a class=\"mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-forest px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cream transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-navy active:translate-y-px dark:bg-forest dark:text-cream dark:hover:bg-mist dark:hover:text-navy\" href=\"mailto:lukasasorensen@gmail.com?subject=RJLS Systems AI readiness audit inquiry\">Email us about an AI readiness audit<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-forest/10 bg-mist/65 px-6 py-16 lg:px-10 lg:py-24 dark:border-cream/20 dark:bg-night-surface/65\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr]\"><div><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-navy dark:text-cream\">From current state to practical next steps.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[44ch] leading-7 text-forest dark:text-sage\">A focused process that turns scattered signals into an ordered plan.</p></div><div><article class=\"grid gap-3 border-b border-forest/15 py-6 first:pt-0 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0 sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] dark:border-cream/25\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-navy dark:text-cream\">Discover</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Review current employee AI usage, approved tools, policies, and existing developer integrations.</p></article><article class=\"grid gap-3 border-b border-forest/15 py-6 first:pt-0 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0 sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] dark:border-cream/25\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-navy dark:text-cream\">Assess</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Examine data exposure, access boundaries, output quality, operational visibility, and cost controls.</p></article><article class=\"grid gap-3 border-b border-forest/15 py-6 first:pt-0 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0 sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] dark:border-cream/25\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-navy dark:text-cream\">Prioritize</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Rank risk reduction and implementation opportunities by urgency, effort, and business value.</p></article><article class=\"grid gap-3 border-b border-forest/15 py-6 first:pt-0 last:border-b-0 last:pb-0 sm:grid-cols-[9rem_1fr] dark:border-cream/25\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.025em] text-navy dark:text-cream\">Plan</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Deliver an executive-ready summary and a practical roadmap for the next phase of work.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:px-10 lg:py-24\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-fingerprint-pattern size-6 text-forest dark:text-mint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10a2 2 0 0 0-2 2c0 1.02-.1 2.51-.26 4\"></path><path d=\"M14 13.12c0 2.38 0 6.38-1 8.88\"></path><path d=\"M17.29 21.02c.12-.6.43-2.3.5-3.02\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a10 10 0 0 1 18-6\"></path><path d=\"M2 16h.01\"></path><path d=\"M21.8 16c.2-2 .131-5.354 0-6\"></path><path d=\"M5 19.5C5.5 18 6 15 6 12a6 6 0 0 1 .34-2\"></path><path d=\"M8.65 22c.21-.66.45-1.32.57-2\"></path><path d=\"M9 6.8a6 6 0 0 1 9 5.2v2\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-navy dark:text-cream\">What you receive</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[46ch] leading-7 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Clear evidence for leadership decisions, plus an implementation order your team can use.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-xl bg-mist p-5 dark:bg-night-surface\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 flex-none text-forest dark:text-mint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Current-state AI usage and integration review.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-xl bg-mist p-5 dark:bg-night-surface\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 flex-none text-forest dark:text-mint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Risk and opportunity map across employees, data, systems, and developer workflows.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-xl bg-mist p-5 dark:bg-night-surface\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 flex-none text-forest dark:text-mint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Prioritized roadmap for controls, tooling, training, and implementation work.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-xl bg-mist p-5 dark:bg-night-surface\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 flex-none text-forest dark:text-mint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Executive-ready summary with recommended next steps.</p></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"border-t border-forest/10 bg-cream px-6 py-10 lg:px-10 dark:border-cream/20 dark:bg-night\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end\"><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold text-navy dark:text-cream\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-md bg-forest font-mono text-xs text-cream dark:bg-forest dark:text-cream\">RJ</span>RJLS Systems</a><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-forest dark:text-sage\">Add AI that works with your app&#x27;s data and workflows, with access and actions scoped to the job.</p><a class=\"mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-forest underline decoration-forest/40 underline-offset-4 tr